@startuml
title Update Topic Sequence (/api/admin/topics/{id})
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Edit Topic UI" as EditTopicPage
control "TopicsController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "AdminTopic\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeTopicDto
entity "WordListItem\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeWordDto
entity "UpdateTopicRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as TopicRequestDto
entity "TopicSummaryResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as TopicResponseDto
control "AdminTopicsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "ITopicAdminService" as ITopicAdminService
control "TopicAdminService" as TopicService
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordTopic" as WordTopicEntity
control "ITopicAdminRepository" as ITopicAdminRepository
control "TopicAdminRepository" as TopicRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over EditTopicPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard TopicsController loads topic data, then posts update data through VocaNovaApiClient.
API uses UpdateTopicRequest and returns TopicSummaryResponse.
FE response DTOs exist: AdminTopic and WordListItem for loading edit data.
UpdateTopicRequest can replace topic word links with word_ids.
Interfaces used in code: ITopicAdminService, ITopicAdminRepository.
end note
Admin -> EditTopicPage: Open edit topic page
EditTopicPage -> DashboardController: GET /topics/{id}/edit
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetAdminTopicsAsync()\nGET /api/admin/topics
ApiController -> FeTopicDto: HTTP 200 OK\nAdminTopic JSON
FeTopicDto --> DashboardController: Existing topics
alt Topic not found
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show not found
else Topic found
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetWordsAsync(topic filter)
ApiController -> FeWordDto: HTTP 200 OK\nPaged WordListItem JSON
FeWordDto --> DashboardController: Topic vocabulary words
end
Admin -> EditTopicPage: Update topic name,\nVietnamese name?, icon?, words?
Admin -> EditTopicPage: Submit form
EditTopicPage -> DashboardController: POST /topics/{id}/update
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate form input\nand selected words
alt Form input invalid
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show validation message
else Form input valid
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetAdminTopicsAsync()\nGET /api/admin/topics
ApiController -> FeTopicDto: HTTP 200 OK\nAdminTopic JSON
FeTopicDto --> DashboardController: Existing topics
alt Topic name already exists
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show duplicate topic message
else Topic can be submitted
DashboardController -> TopicRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.UpdateTopicAsync(id, input)\nCreate request data(topic_name, topic_name_vi?,icon?, word_ids?)
TopicRequestDto -> ApiController: PUT /api/admin/topics/{id}\nUpdateTopicRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate UpdateTopicRequest
alt Request validation fails
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show error message
else Request validation success
ApiController -> ITopicAdminService: UpdateAsync(id, update data)
ITopicAdminService -> TopicService: UpdateAsync(id, update data)
TopicService -> ITopicAdminService: Normalize topic data
ITopicAdminService -> TopicService: Normalize topic data
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: NameExistsAsync(topicName, topicNameVi, id)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: NameExistsAsync(topicName, topicNameVi, id)
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Query duplicate topic name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Topic row or null
DbContext -> TopicEntity: Materialize Topic?
TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic or null
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Result
TopicRepository --> TopicService: exists or not
alt Topic name already exists
TopicService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show error message
else Topic name is available
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: WordIdsExistAsync(wordIds)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: WordIdsExistAsync(wordIds)
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Check selected vocabulary words
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word rows count
DbContext -> WordEntity: Materialize Word rows
WordEntity --> DbContext: Words
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Result
TopicRepository --> TopicService: valid or invalid
alt Selected word id invalid
TopicService --> ApiController: Validation failure
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show error message
else Selected words valid
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: UpdateAsync(id, update data)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: UpdateAsync(id, update data)
TopicRepository -> TopicEntity: Update Topic
TopicEntity --> TopicRepository: Topic
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Track Topic update
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
opt word_ids supplied
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Replace topic word links
TopicRepository -> WordTopicEntity: Replace WordTopic links
WordTopicEntity --> TopicRepository: WordTopic links
DbContext -> MySQL: DELETE/INSERT word_topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
end
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Topic summary or null
TopicRepository --> TopicService: Updated topic or null
alt Topic not found
TopicService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Show error message
else Topic updated
TopicService --> ApiController: Return updated topic
ApiController -> TopicResponseDto: Create response data(TopicSummaryResponse)
TopicResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK\nTopicSummaryResponse
DashboardController --> EditTopicPage: Redirect to topic list
end
end
end
end
end
end
@enduml
